description	"Astromech Droid

A plucky support with numerous gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Prod (Wookiee-style Melee)
-- Heavyweight
-- Secondary fire only
- Circular Saw (Staff Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Staggers on hit
-- 95% less damage
-- 50% shorter
-- 66% thicker
- Jet Flamethrower
-- 150% slower RoF
-- 50% slower mag reload

^5Powers:
- Steam Projector (Push 1)
- Electroshock Probe (Lightning 1) ^3[CS4]
-- 100% more damage
- Overclock (Speed 3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Impact Diffusion
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Healing (2)
- Resource Regen: 2/1s
- Passive Radar Scanner (Miraluka 1)
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Blasterbound
- 25% faster hacking

^3Abilities:
- Armor/BP/Resource Dispenser (2) ^3[Use]
-- +1 range
- Jet Boosters (Jetpack)
- Mini-Blaster (Wrist Laser) ^3[CS1]
- Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]
- Headbutt (Flipkick 1) ^3[Contact Jump]"